@startuml agent-builder-architecture
title Agent Builder — **PHASE 3: validate + reload**\nGREEN = new · ORANGE = modified · GREY = existing, untouched

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam class {
  BorderColor #444
  ArrowColor #555
}

legend top left
  |<#C8E6C9>       | **NEW** in phase 3 |
  |<#FFE0B2>       | **MODIFIED** in phase 3 (new members marked NEW) |
  |<#E0E0E0>       | **EXISTING** — reused as-is |
  == plugins/ is the OUTERMOST ring: it imports agent_runtime, never the reverse ==
  == (.importlinter contract: core-not-import-plugins) ==
endlegend

' ═══════════════════════ CORE — agent_runtime ═══════════════════════
package "agent_runtime/domain" #F5F5F5 {
  class AgentSpec <<entity>> #E0E0E0 {
    +id / name / version
    +app : dict | None
    +plugins : dict
    +tools_allow / skills_allow
    +dir : Path | None
  }
  enum PluginOrigin #E0E0E0 {
    BUILTIN
    FIRST_PARTY
    THIRD_PARTY_BUNDLE
    --
    +is_untrusted : bool
  }
  class CapabilityGrant <<value>> #E0E0E0 {
    DEFAULT-DENY
    +secrets = {}
    +files / network / cpu / mem
    .. never sees provider keys ..
  }
}

package "agent_runtime/application/interfaces" #F5F5F5 {
  abstract class Tool <<port>> #E0E0E0 {
    +name / description / parameters / label
    {abstract} +execute(tool_call_id, params, abort, on_update)
  }
  interface AgentRegistry <<port>> #E0E0E0 {
    +resolve(session_key)
    +get(agent_id)
    +list_ids()
    .. add()/refresh() are NOT on this port ..
  }
  class PluginContext #FFE0B2 {
    +config : object
    +plugin_dir : str
    +registry : object
    +register_plugin_live : object
    +browser / task_store / memory_bank / ...
    __ NEW __
    +broadcast_agents_changed : object = None
    .. late-bound callable() -> the Gateway's ..
    .. agents.changed fan-out. ADDITIVE field. ..
  }
}

package "agent_runtime/infrastructure" #F5F5F5 {
  class FileAgentRegistry <<adapter>> #E0E0E0 {
    +agents_dir : Path
    +refresh() : list[str]
    +add(agent_id) : AgentSpec
    +get(agent_id) / list_ids()
    -_load_dir(agent_id, d) : AgentSpec
    .. THE agent.toml parser ..
  }
  class discovery <<module>> #E0E0E0 {
    +discover_agent_plugins(agents_dir, config, deps, entitlement)
    .. stamps _agent_id on every private tool ..
  }
  class classify <<module>> #E0E0E0 {
    +classify_origin(tool, config) : PluginOrigin
    +wrap_untrusted(tools, sandbox, resolver, config)
    .. _agent_id set => THIRD_PARTY_BUNDLE ..
  }
  class bundle_io <<module>> #E0E0E0 {
    +EXCLUDED_DIRS = {workspace, clients}
    +pack_bundle() / unpack_bundle()
  }
}

package "agent_runtime/presentation" #F5F5F5 {
  class Gateway #FFE0B2 {
    +serve() / _handle_conn()
    -_agents_create()
    -_agents_list() : dict
    -_send_all(frame)
    __ NEW __
    +broadcast_agents_changed()
    .. extracted from _agents_create so a ..
    .. plugin can trigger the SAME fan-out ..
  }
}

package "agent_runtime/main" #F5F5F5 {
  class container #FFE0B2 {
    +register_plugin_live() : dict
    -_agent_private_tools() : dict
    -_late : dict
    __ NEW __
    plugin_deps["broadcast_agents_changed"]
    .. late-bound gateway callable — the same ..
    .. _late pattern register_plugin_live uses ..
  }
}

' ═══════════════════════ NEW BUNDLE ═══════════════════════
package "plugins/agent-builder  «NEW BUNDLE»" #F5F5F5 {

  class plugin_toml <<manifest>> #C8E6C9 {
    id = "agent-builder"
    kind = "native"
    entry = "agent_builder_plugin:register"
  }

  class agent_builder_plugin <<composition root>> #C8E6C9 {
    +register(api, ctx)
    .. builds services, injects adapters, ..
    .. registers both tools ..
  }

  package "domain  (pure, no I/O)" {
    class Finding <<value>> #C8E6C9 {
      +level : str
      +code : str
      +message : str
      +path : str
    }
    class Report <<value>> #C8E6C9 {
      +agent_id : str
      +findings : list[Finding]
      +ok : bool
      +as_text() : str
    }
    class AgentLayoutRules <<pure>> #C8E6C9 {
      +check(listing, spec) : list[Finding]
      __ checks __
      agent.toml + IDENTITY.md exist
      display keys NOT inside [app]
      [app] holds only its five keys
      skills/<n>/SKILL.md shape
      plugins/<pid>/plugin.toml + entry
    }
    class PackageabilityRules <<pure>> #C8E6C9 {
      +check(spec, listing) : list[Finding]
      __ checks __
      [app] present => can become an exe
      version set => installs supersede
      ui/ entry file actually exists
      nothing needed sits in workspace/
    }
    class SandboxRules <<pure>> #C8E6C9 {
      +check(spec, listing, config) : list[Finding]
      __ checks __
      agents/<id>/plugins/* is UNTRUSTED
      warn when its code needs network
      or env secrets under default-deny
      point at sandbox_trusted_plugins
    }
  }

  package "application  (orchestration)" {
    class ValidateAgentService #C8E6C9 {
      -_reader : AgentDirReader
      -_rules : list
      +validate(agent_id) : Report
      .. parse -> run every rule -> Report ..
    }
    class ReloadAgentService #C8E6C9 {
      -_reloader : RegistryReloadAdapter
      +reload(agent_id) : dict
      .. re-read + register + announce ..
    }
  }

  package "infrastructure  (I/O only)" {
    class AgentDirReader <<adapter>> #C8E6C9 {
      -_registry
      +spec(agent_id) : AgentSpec
      +listing(agent_id) : list[str]
      +read(rel_path) : str
      .. delegates the PARSE to core ..
    }
    class RegistryReloadAdapter <<adapter>> #C8E6C9 {
      -_registry
      -_register_plugin_live
      -_broadcast
      +reload(agent_id) : dict
      .. refresh/add -> plugin rediscovery ..
      .. -> agents.changed ..
    }
  }

  package "presentation  (tool surface)" {
    class ValidateAgentTool <<Tool>> #C8E6C9 {
      +name = "validate_agent"
      +default_retryable = True
      +parameters = {agent_id}
      +execute(...)
    }
    class ReloadAgentTool <<Tool>> #C8E6C9 {
      +name = "reload_agent"
      +default_retryable = False
      +parameters = {agent_id}
      +execute(...)
    }
  }
}

package "agents/main/skills" #F5F5F5 {
  class "build-agent/SKILL.md" as SKILL #FFE0B2 {
    (phase 1) full agent.toml schema
    (phase 1) plugin / skill / ui layout
    __ NEW __
    + SANDBOX section: a private plugin is
      THIRD_PARTY_BUNDLE, default-deny, no
      secrets; how to request an exemption
    + document validate_agent / reload_agent
      in the "order of work"
  }
}

' ═══════════════════════ RELATIONS ═══════════════════════
ValidateAgentTool ..|> Tool
ReloadAgentTool   ..|> Tool
FileAgentRegistry ..|> AgentRegistry

ValidateAgentTool o--> ValidateAgentService
ReloadAgentTool   o--> ReloadAgentService

ValidateAgentService --> AgentLayoutRules
ValidateAgentService --> PackageabilityRules
ValidateAgentService --> SandboxRules
ValidateAgentService --> AgentDirReader
ValidateAgentService ..> Report
AgentLayoutRules ..> Finding
PackageabilityRules ..> Finding
SandboxRules ..> Finding

PackageabilityRules ..> bundle_io : mirrors EXCLUDED_DIRS
SandboxRules ..> classify : mirrors the _agent_id rule
classify ..> PluginOrigin
classify ..> CapabilityGrant

ReloadAgentService --> RegistryReloadAdapter
AgentDirReader --> FileAgentRegistry : reuses _load_dir parse\n(one source of truth)
RegistryReloadAdapter --> FileAgentRegistry : refresh() / add()
RegistryReloadAdapter ..> discovery : re-discover NEW private plugins
RegistryReloadAdapter ..> Gateway : broadcast_agents_changed()
FileAgentRegistry --> AgentSpec

agent_builder_plugin ..> ValidateAgentTool : constructs
agent_builder_plugin ..> ReloadAgentTool : constructs
agent_builder_plugin --> PluginContext : reads registry,\nregister_plugin_live,\nbroadcast_agents_changed
plugin_toml ..> agent_builder_plugin : entry=

container ..> PluginContext : fills the handles
container ..> Gateway : late-binds the broadcast

SKILL ..> ValidateAgentTool : tells the model to call it
SKILL ..> ReloadAgentTool

note as N1 #E3F2FD
  **The one core edit this phase needs.**
  PluginContext has no way to emit an event, so a plugin tool cannot
  refresh the client's agent list. One ADDITIVE field
  (broadcast_agents_changed) + late-binding in container.py — the same
  pattern register_plugin_live already uses. PluginContext's own
  docstring says "new fields are additive", so this is its intended
  extension path, not a workaround.
end note

note as N2 #FFF3E0
  **Why SandboxRules exists.**
  classify_origin(): a tool tagged _agent_id (anything under
  agents/<id>/plugins/) is THIRD_PARTY_BUNDLE => untrusted => runs under
  a DEFAULT-DENY CapabilityGrant with secrets = {}.
  That is exactly where phase 2's create_tool --agent writes. So a
  self-authored tool needing network or an API key will fail once
  AGENTD_SANDBOX_PLUGINS is on — and nothing warns the author today.
  This rule makes it visible AT AUTHORING TIME.
end note

note as N3 #E3F2FD
  **Validation never re-implements the schema.**
  AgentDirReader asks FileAgentRegistry to parse. If a directory yields
  an AgentSpec it is structurally valid. The rules only add what the
  DAEMON tolerates but the PIPELINE or the SANDBOX does not.
end note

N1 .. PluginContext
N2 .. SandboxRules
N3 .. AgentDirReader

@enduml
